                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even with friends, this game is rough. I do not recommend.\n\nCons:\nThe controls do not feel very responsive.\nThe matches get boring very quick.\nThe best strategy I found that kept me winning was button mashing.\nSome modes are broken (standing on the goal in basketball mode prevents anyone from ever scoring).\nSome of the achievements take a stupid amount of time, especially compared with the point above.\nThere are random obstacles in some levels that erratically impact game play (slow moving lasers that hit the ball in another direction?)\nSome shots seem like they will definitely go in, but miss, while others that would never make it somehow score.\nCPU seems either way too dumb or way too good.\n\nPros:\nIt's a 4-player couch game.\nIt was fun for the first few minutes, at least.\nLittle kids loved the button mashing.",
